OL,3,AComplaints to watchdog about water
OL,4,Afirms jump 84%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of complaints made by
OL,7,Fhouseholds about water companies to the
OL,8,Findustry watchdog has risen by a record
OL,9,F84% in a year, driven by customer
OL,10,Fconcern and confusion over rising
OL,11,Fbills.
OL,13,FThe Consumer Council for Water (CCW)
OL,14,Fsaid the year-on-year increase was the
OL,15,Fhighest in its 20-year history and
OL,16,Fshowed "just how dissatisfied" many
OL,17,Fpeople were.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
