OL,3,AComplaints to watchdog about water
OL,4,Afirms jump 84%
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater customers in England and Wales
OL,7,Fhave been hit with steep price hikes in
OL,8,Frecent years. The regulator Ofwat has
OL,9,Falso allowed firms to put up bills by
OL,10,F36% between 2025 and 2030.
OL,12,FWater UK, which represents firms, said
OL,13,Fit understood that higher bills was
OL,14,Fnever welcome, but the money was needed
OL,15,F"to fund vital upgrades".
